{
  "_comment": [
    "BATTLE 01 - North Meadow Ambush. The player's first battle.",
    "",
    "GRID CONVENTION, which applies to every battle file:",
    "  x runs 0..width-1 west to east.",
    "  y runs 0..height-1 SOUTH to north.",
    "  The `terrain` array is written NORTH FIRST, so row 0 of the array is",
    "  y = height-1. The file therefore reads like a map seen from above with",
    "  north at the top, which is how it gets edited.",
    "  Symbols are defined in Content/Data/terrain.json.",
    "",
    "Teaching load, in the order the script introduces it: grid, movement range,",
    "attack, magic and MP, weapon range, height. Nothing else. Terrain defence",
    "and evasion are active but not explained - the player meets those properly",
    "in Chapter One."
  ],
