        { "type": "set_flag", "flag": "archer_took_hill", "value": true, "scope": "battle" },
        { "type": "focus_camera", "position": [5, 11] }
      ],
      "notes": "Scripted rather than left to the AI so the height tutorial is guaranteed to fire. From Chapter One onward the AI makes this decision itself."
